# Target bonus — DXC Technology CFO side letter (real SEC filing)

> Module Incentive_comp_dxc_side_letter

Source: EDGAR-002, DXC Technology EX-10.7 side letter, filed 2025. Encoded to show the
same clause shape running on a real filed document rather than an authored one.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope IncentiveCompDxc:
  input annual_base_salary content money
  output target_bonus_rate content decimal
  output target_bonus content money
```

## EDGAR-002 ¶ 2–3

  Effective as of April 1, 2025, your base salary will be increased to $800,000 per year,
  and shall be payable in accordance with the Company's normal U.S. payroll practices.
  Effective as of April 1, 2025, your target annual bonus under the Company's annual
  incentive plan will be increased to 135% of your base salary.

```catala
scope IncentiveCompDxc:
  definition target_bonus_rate equals 135%
  definition target_bonus equals annual_base_salary * target_bonus_rate
```
